 AltarSMP-Custom-Content/packs/pack.zip     | Bin 304106 -> 296228 bytes
 tools/crossplay/geometry.py                |  29 ++------
 tools/crossplay/javapack.py                |  76 +++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/crossplay/render.py                  |  27 +++++---
 tools/crossplay/validate_custom_content.py |  61 ++++++++---------
 5 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 63 deletions(-)

